{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>據了解，WhatsApp 近日為 iOS 版本推出重新設計的訊息氣泡，造型比以往更圓潤，風格類似 iMessage；共用媒體檔案亦去掉原有邊框，視覺效果更簡潔。</p><p>今次訊息氣泡更新延續上月 iPhone 及 iPad 聊天介面採用的 Liquid Glass 設計語言，整體介面一致性進一步提升。</p><p>消息來源</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9f0f4c914f5060e006f64572bfdbd208a3b98b4885036f8db8e9c0f5b2eb6614/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F7298734841bd21383cbc318e5e5a2d21\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-25T01:43:37.687522+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}